ring in the restaurant's review list. This shows the app does not enforce that a review requires a completed reservation for that restaurant, nor limits reviews to one per completed reservation.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applying GROUP15 with party size 2 was rejected with \\\"Coupon Not Applicable - This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\" Setting party size to 6 and reapplying succeeded (\\\"15% off for parties of 6 or more\\\"). Once a coupon is applied, the coupon code input is replaced by the applied badge and only a remove control remains, preventing a second coupon from being applied at the same time (must remove first) — enforcing at most one coupon per reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation feedback shown to user\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the reservation form with no date, time, guest name, email, or phone silently fails: no reservation is created (confirmed via My Reservations showing 0 upcoming), but no error message, toast, aria-invalid attribute, or error styling appears anywhere on the page or in the notification region. The user receives no indication of what is missing or invalid.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify dialog opened via \\\"Modify\\\" button, changes to time/party size saved via \\\"Save Changes\\\" and reflected immediately. Cancel button opened an alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" requiring explicit \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\" click (with a \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" escape option that correctly left the reservation intact when tested); only after confirming did the reservation get cancelled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Creating a reservation showed an immediate toast \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" plus confirmation panel, and it appeared in Upcoming reservations without reload. Modifying time/party size showed updated values (20:00, 4 Guests) reflected immediately in the reservations list in the same session without a manual reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Upcoming tab (1) shows Trattoria Bella reservation with status \\\"Upcoming\\\", date August 27 2026, time 19:00, party size 6 Guests, location \\\"Little Italy\\\", and \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\". Past tab (1) shows the earlier Sakura Garden reservation with status \\\"Cancelled\\\", retaining date/time/party size. Statuses (Upcoming vs Cancelled) are visually distinct and reservations are correctly separated into Upcoming vs Past tabs.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Before review: Trattoria Bella showed rating 4.0 (1 review) on detail page. After submitting a 5-star review, detail page updated to 4.5 (2 reviews), and the restaurant list card (after full navigation/reload) also shows 4.5, confirming consistency between list and detail summaries derived from reviews.\"}]}"
